      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The discovery of a potent mitogen for insulin-producing pancreatic β cells, optimistically termed \"betatrophin,\" excited researchers and laypeople alike, promising a new therapeutic approach to diabetes. A recent \"Matters Arising\" report by Gusarova and colleagues (2014) places serious doubts on whether \"betatrophin\" plays any major role in β cell replication."
      },
